on unlock role, actor
  if role is not "target" then
    pass unlock
  end if
  ask mua to command
  put it into cmd
  if the indirect of cmd is nothing then
    return "There is no keyhole you can see."
  end if
  put the name of the described of the indirect of cmd into thing
  ask world to resolve the in of the location of actor
  tell mua to announce it, the name of the player of actor & " fiddles with the puzzle box.", actor
  return "You press the " & thing & " into a gap between the panels."
end unlock
